# ─── MODU · Environment Variables Template ────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env.local — it is already in .gitignore.
#
# Currently this project has no required environment variables (static site).
# Add here when integrating:
#   · Shopify Storefront API
#   · Email delivery (Resend, SendGrid, etc.)
#   · Analytics

# Example — Shopify Storefront API (not active yet)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-token-here

# Example — Contact form email delivery (not active yet)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# CONTACT_EMAIL=hola@modu.es
